



>> CoffeeGrounds := ବସ୍ତୁ ନୂତନ.
CoffeeGrounds ଯେବେ: ['extract'] କର: { <- ['coffee']. }.

>> CoffeeMachine := ବସ୍ତୁ ନୂତନ.
CoffeeMachine ଯେବେ: ['init'] କର: {
	ନିଜର coffeegrounds := CoffeeGrounds ନୂତନ.
}.
CoffeeMachine ଯେବେ: ['ନୂତନ'] କର: { <- CoffeeMachine `new init.
}.

CoffeeMachine ଯେବେ: ['makeTea'] କର: { <- (ନିଜର tealeaves extract). }.
CoffeeMachine ଯେବେ: ['makeCoffee'] କର: { <- (ନିଜର coffeegrounds extract). }.

>> coffeeDream := CoffeeMachine ନୂତନ.

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ:
	coffeeDream 
	makeCoffee.

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ:
	coffeeDream 
	makeTea.
